title: About
seoDescription: The story of Hotel Atlantis, a small hotel in De Pijp, Amsterdam.
---
## Our story

Hotel Atlantis stands on Ceintuurbaan in De Pijp, a few streets outside the canal ring. Six room types across four floors, a breakfast room at the front, and a reception desk that never closes.

The neighbourhood does most of the work. The Albert Cuypmarkt is around the corner, the Museumplein is five minutes away on the tram, and the historic centre about a quarter of an hour. We keep the rooms comfortable, the coffee coming and the front desk staffed, so you can spend your time out in the city rather than in the hotel.
